  "details": "When recording a video with the dolly camera in build `1591`, the video uses the 'photo resolution' setting. As shown in the attached photo, the video is exported in 4K with a high bitrate, resulting in a 35-second clip that exceeds half a gigabyte in size. It might be worth considering export options for the video camera to prevent accidentally recording videos that consume excessive storage space, or at the very least, using the 'stream resolution' setting for video recording.",
